; Synthesized positional atom. `test/synth-positional-v1` lowers a contentless
; (shader-decl) sugar form into (module shader) — a head plus a lone *positional
; symbol*, with no kvpair. Before EmittedForm.children became []EmittedValue a
; hook could emit only kvpairs and nested forms, never a bare atom, so this
; shape was inexpressible. The `module` terminal is `:open true :positional any`,
; so the synthesized symbol child validates as an untyped positional; the head
; is listed in the sugar form's `:produces`.
(plugin :name gfx :version "1.0.0"
  (form :name shader-decl :open true
    :lowering (lowering :hook test/synth-positional-v1 :produces [module]))
  (form :name module :open true :positional any))

(shader-decl)
